# This repo publishes only the pipeline's own code (main.nf, nextflow.config,
# workflows/, subworkflows/, modules/, bin/ scripts). Everything else —
# benchmark data, reference data, test datasets, run output, working notes —
# stays local and is excluded below.

### Data / benchmark / working notes — not published ###
/archive/
/context/
/data/
/logs/
/TEST/

### Benchmark — data/results stay local, only the write-up and the
### figures it actually embeds are published.
### /benchmark/* (not /benchmark/) so the !negations below can reach into it —
### git won't apply a negation to a path inside a directory that's ignored outright.
/benchmark/*
!/benchmark/README.md
!/benchmark/figures/

### Nextflow run state and output ###
.nextflow/
.nextflow.log*
.nextflow.pid
work/
results/

### Run artifacts (regenerated by every run, not meant to be versioned) ###
/log
nohup.out
*.nohup.log
report.html
trace.txt
timeline.html
dag.html
multiqc_report.html
multiqc_data/
nextflow.config.bak.*
*.agat.log
null.overlaps.csv

### Loose local samplesheets (personal paths, not part of the pipeline) ###
/samplesheet*.csv
/test.csv

### Standalone scripts not wired into the pipeline graph (benchmark/curation
### tooling, not Nextflow pipeline code) ###
/nat_caller_summary.R
/bin/nat_curate.py
/bin/tsv_sample.py

### Leftover manual-run output, not code ###
/bin/res_sg/

### Personal reference notes — not for publication ###
/REMOVED_UNUSED_CODE.md

### Disconnected from the live workflow (orphaned modules / dead scripts) —
### kept on disk in case they get finished/reconnected later, see
### REMOVED_UNUSED_CODE.md (local only, see above) for why each one is here ###
/modules/local/seqkit/concat/
/modules/local/flair/create_manifests/
/modules/nf-core/sortmerna/
/modules/nf-core/multiqc/
/bin/script_extract_overlap.py
/bin/script_extract_overlap_mod.py

### Superseded by a proper README/doc written for the public repo ###
/PIPELINE_OVERVIEW.md

### Vendored SQANTI3: keep its code, drop its bundled example/test data ###
bin/SQANTI3/data/

### Compiled binaries (built locally from source, not vendored in git — see bin/) ###
bin/intron-prospector
bin/intron-prospector-merge

### Python ###
__pycache__/
*.pyc

### OS / editor junk ###
.DS_Store
